WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.637
Run the monthly order project and verify the row
meaning Each row

00:00:05.664 --> 00:00:11.507
now represents one month not one order The grouped
measures summarize

00:00:11.534 --> 00:00:17.056
all order events in that month This is a good
example of using temporal

00:00:17.082 --> 00:00:20.543
preparation to create an analysis-ready table at a
new grain
